IDs.", "Usage"], Cell["Status: Alpha.", "Notes"], 
  Cell["Option for CacheCG, TensorProductVectors and CGPolynomialResult: All, \
an irrep ID or a list of IDs selecting final targets.", "Notes"], 
  Cell["All (default), an irrep ID or a duplicate-free list of irrep IDs.", 
   "Notes"], 
  Cell["The owning function rejects other values before any computation.", 
